a, Italy and Bulgaria. Mann investigates historic and spiritual threads connnecting gnostic groups from China to France, from the to the 15th century. Included are secret gnostic connections to the Knights Templar and Holy Grail, along with influences of the Kaballah, Sufism and Taoism on gnostics of the Balkans and western Europe."},"isbn_10":["0961929073"],"local_id":["urn:sfpl:31223101794734","urn:sfpl:31223101794742"],"full_title":"The trail of Gnosis a lucid exploration of Gnostic traditions","last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2019-07-17T23:26:29.372689"},"latest_revision":1,"key":"/books/OL27141900M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL956929A","name":"Judith Mann"}],"publish_places":["[Calif.]"],"edition_name":"Rev. 4th ed.","pagination":"[12], 185, [26] p.","source_records":["marc:marc_openlibraries_sanfranciscopubliclibrary/sfpl_chq_2018_12_24_run04.mrc:301503382:2175"],"title":"The trail of Gnosis","notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Includes bibliographical references and index."},"number_of_pages":185,"isbn_13":["9780961929077"],"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2019-07-17T23:26:29.372689"},"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"subjects":["Gnosticism","History"],"publish_date":"2012","publish_country":"cau","copyright_date":"2002","by_statement":"Judith Mann","oclc_numbers":["829135525"],"works":[{"key":"/works/OL19961667W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"revision":1}},"ISBN:9781282964785":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781282964785","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL29192725M/God_Interrupted","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL29192725M/God_Interrupted","details":{"publishers":["Princeton University Press"],"subtitle":"Heresy and the European Imagination Between the World Wars","last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2020-08-23T03:20:03.237308"},"source_records":["bwb:9781282964785"],"title":"God Interrupted","number_of_pages":270,"isbn_13":["9781282964785"],"created":{"type":"/type/datetime",